sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI
    participant LocalState
    participant Firestore
    
    Note over User,Firestore: User selects time slot
    
    User->>UI: Click "Book Appointment"
    
    rect rgb(144, 238, 144)
        Note over UI,LocalState: Optimistic Update
        UI->>LocalState: Add booking immediately
        UI->>User: Show success state
        Note over User: Instant feedback ⚡
    end
    
    UI->>Firestore: Start async write
    
    alt Success Path
        Firestore-->>UI: Write confirmed
        UI->>LocalState: Confirm booking
        Note over User: Booking persisted ✓
    else Failure Path (Network/Conflict)
        Firestore-->>UI: Error returned
        rect rgb(255, 182, 193)
            Note over UI,LocalState: Rollback
            UI->>LocalState: Remove booking
            UI->>User: Show error + revert UI
            Note over User: Graceful degradation
        end
    end
    
    Note over Firestore: Offline: Changes queued<br/>Online: Auto-sync
